{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made by solo developer ILBB, LUSTBORN is a retro third-person action platformer that delivers an exciting single-player adventure where you shoot, jump, and navigate your way through a twisted realm of lust and depravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343320/extras/Clip_1.gif?t=1750772111\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the near future, a tear in reality opens a portal to an alternate dimension known as NEERAH'OR. A powerful demon-queen, driven by insatiable lust, seeks to infiltrate our world and spread death and depravity. In response, a global taskforce called OPUS-Y is formed. But alas, every mission into NEERAH'OR ends in disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hope remains in the discovery of a rare breed of women resistant to the demon-queen's dark magic. You play as MIA MADDEN, the latest recruit and the last known descendant of this secret lineage. Though little is known of her powers, she is the last... LUSTBORN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343320/extras/Clip_3.gif?t=1750772111\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT TO EXPECT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The beautiful Mia Madden shoots, jumps, rolls and climbs with real-time soft-body physics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging third-person retro gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arena shootouts with a classic arsenal </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Platforming and maneuvering through obstacles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world and collect items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 sexy outfits (including 2 which are only available if &q